# Development snapshot of TCGCSV, ~3 MB, 84 files.
#
# Deliberately NOT deployed. source.js falls back to it when no Worker URL is
# configured, which is what makes the app buildable and testable offline. If it
# were published, a visitor with no Worker would silently read frozen prices
# from whenever this was downloaded, instead of being told to set up the Worker.
mockapi/
.price-cache/
__pycache__/

# The version log. 841 lines of reasoning that a browser would download and
# ignore on every cold load, so it was lifted out of index.html. Local only by
# choice -- it is the working history of this app, not part of the product.
CHANGELOG.md
